 "about": "PROPOSED for the kit (kit change request 19 Oct 2026, MEP item 3). A marker a person drops in a WIP model to steer Auto-MEP (E4): one type per hint kind; the kind is in FMC_AI_Hint_Kind so Auto-MEP reads data, not type names. A flat 10 mm zone, sized per placement (instance Width and Depth, 600 x 600 mm as drawn; the person stretches zones to size), on the subcategory 'Clearance AI Hint' so it follows the kit's Clearance rule: shown in working views, turned off by every print view template, like Clearance zones. Never scheduled, priced or exported as a building element. Needs FMC_AI_Hint_Kind, FMC_Auto_Run and FMC_Auto_Locked from FMC_Auto_MEP_Parameters (GUIDs by the kit's uuid5 method). Not built or Revit-checked: Gate A runs when the kit approves it. The name follows the kit's token order; the request calls it FMC_AI_Hint_Marker for short.",
